index=entra sourcetype="azure:loganalytics:auditlogs" Category="UserManagement" "security info" earliest=-1h latest=now
``` ========================================================================== ```
``` Detection (SPL): Contoso ITDR - Authentication method added to a break-glass account ```
``` Lab:             Contoso Health Identity Platform - Splunk second SIEM     ```
``` KQL twin:        lab/kql/break-glass-auth-method-added.kql ```
``` -------------------------------------------------------------------------- ```
``` STAND-IN: Splunk Enterprise 60-day TRIAL. Written 2026-11-07 with the     ```
``` fourth ITDR set (review findings B1, B2, C5, D1).                         ```
``` | where match(ActivityDisplayName, "(?i)security info") ```
``` | spath path=TargetResources{}.type output=TT ```
``` | spath path=TargetResources{}.id output=TID ```
``` | spath path=TargetResources{}.userPrincipalName output=TUPN ```
``` | eval TargetObjectId=mvindex(TID, 0), TargetUpn=mvindex(TUPN, 0) ```
``` | lookup contoso_break_glass_users.csv user_id AS TargetObjectId OUTPUT user_id AS BgMatch ```
``` | where isnotnull(BgMatch) OR match(TargetUpn, "(?i)^bg-admin-[0-9]{2}@") ```
``` | spath path=InitiatedBy.user.userPrincipalName output=ActorUpn ```
``` | spath path=InitiatedBy.app.displayName output=ActorApp ```
``` | eval Actor=coalesce(ActorUpn, ActorApp), ActorKind=case(isnotnull(ActorApp) AND ActorApp!="", "application", lower(ActorUpn)==lower(TargetUpn), "the account itself", true(), "an admin") ```
``` | eval Severity=if(match(Result, "(?i)^success$") AND NOT match(ActivityDisplayName, "(?i)deleted"), "High", "Medium") ```
``` | sort 0 - _time ```
``` | table TimeGenerated, Severity, ActivityDisplayName, ResultReason, Result, TargetUpn, TargetObjectId, Actor, ActorKind, CorrelationId ```
``` ========================================================================== ```
